  "description": "Hajun, who lost his parents and lived with his grandmother, has become a police officer to uncover the truth behind his parents’ deaths, but life as a patrol officer is far from the detective career he once dreamed of. It’s nothing but exhausting.\n\n“I wish legendary detectives would appear and give me a clue about the case.” \n\nFeeling frustrated, he visits the old vinyl house where he once lived with his parents… \n\nThere, he finds a book that belongs to his father.\n\nWhen he opens the book, what appears before Hajun’s eyes are legendary murderers? \n\nWait, why are you here?!  \n\n**Original Novel:**\n**[Kakao](https://page.kakao.com/content/61667732)**\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60009718), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%82%B4%EC%9D%B8%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%EB%B7%B0/2973)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://pdt.tencentac.com/?adtag=appshare.ios.detail%26QQ%26336&contentId=336&platform=IA), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/135397)",
